{"id":"d0d9c5344c664448","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-projection-of-tree.md","title":"ZFC Projection Of Tree","display":"df-zfc-projection-of-tree — ZFC Projection Of Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-projection-of-tree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-projection-of-tree"],"display":"df-zfc-projection-of-tree — ZFC Projection Of Tree","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-projection-of-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-projection-of-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-projection-of-tree — ZFC Projection Of Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence\">../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\">\\(X,Y\\)</span> (alphabet sets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,A\\in V\">\\(T,A\\in V\\)</span> (paired-sequence tree and projection candidates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinSeq}(t,X\\times Y)\">\\(\\mathrm{FinSeq}(t,X\\times Y)\\)</span> (finite paired-sequence predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence\">../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"{\\upharpoonright}\">\\({\\upharpoonright}\\)</span> (function predicate and restriction, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProjectionOfTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ProjectionOfTree}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}projection\\text{-}of\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProjectionOfTree}_S(A,T,X,Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nT\\subseteq\\{t:\\mathrm{FinSeq}(t,X\\times Y)\\}\n\\land\n\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\}\\;\n\\bigl(t\\upharpoonright n\\in T\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\nA=\\left\\{x:\\mathrm{Function}(x,\\omega,X)\\land\n\\exists y\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(y,\\omega,Y)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\exists t\\in T\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{dom}(t)=n\\land\n\\forall k\\in n\\;(t(k)=\\langle x(k),y(k)\\rangle)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}projection\\text{-}of\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProjectionOfTree}_S(A,T,X,Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nT\\subseteq\\{t:\\mathrm{FinSeq}(t,X\\times Y)\\}\n\\land\n\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\}\\;\n\\bigl(t\\upharpoonright n\\in T\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\nA=\\left\\{x:\\mathrm{Function}(x,\\omega,X)\\land\n\\exists y\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(y,\\omega,Y)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\exists t\\in T\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{dom}(t)=n\\land\n\\forall k\\in n\\;(t(k)=\\langle x(k),y(k)\\rangle)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The definition now types the paired tree and states its prefix closure before taking its projection.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"f4bf86f66c1444da","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"f4bf86f66c1444da","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinSeq}(t,X\\times Y)$ (finite paired-sequence predicate, see [[../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ and ${\\upharpoonright}$ (function predicate and restriction, see [[../batch16/58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y","display":false},{"tex":"T,A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinSeq}(t,X\\times Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"{\\upharpoonright}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProjectionOfTree}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}projection\\text{-}of\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProjectionOfTree}_S(A,T,X,Y)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nT\\subseteq\\{t:\\mathrm{FinSeq}(t,X\\times Y)\\}\n\\land\n\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\}\\;\n\\bigl(t\\upharpoonright n\\in T\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\nA=\\left\\{x:\\mathrm{Function}(x,\\omega,X)\\land\n\\exists y\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(y,\\omega,Y)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\exists t\\in T\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{dom}(t)=n\\land\n\\forall k\\in n\\;(t(k)=\\langle x(k),y(k)\\rangle)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1490,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3207","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-projection-of-tree.md|58-df-zfc-projection-of-tree]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","f4bf86f66c1444da","36d7463d215be751"]}